; $82EC - Called from 82BE, 82C3, 82C7, 82CB, 82CF ***JMP : Uses a calculated jump
; Arguments: X=Vector of address of BASIC table vector, XL=INIT=D0, INPUT#=ED,PRINT#=EE, PRINT#2=EF, MERGE=F0
; Outputs:
